13:["$","p",null,{"children":"In your classes, mathematics was never just numbers on a board, and computing was never just lines on a screen. They were ways of thinking clearly, of being curious, of trying again. You made difficult things feel possible, and you made all of us feel that we were capable of more than we knew."}]
14:["$","p",null,{"children":"On your birthday, we wanted to give something back — not as grand as what you have given us, but honest. These messages are small pieces of a much larger thank you."}]
15:["$","p",null,{"className":"wyG1RW_closing","children":"We wish you a year of good health, quiet joys, and the same wonder you bring into every room. Happy birthday, Rahul Sir."}]
